    "aa-index-v4.3-2026-09-10": "Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v4.3, read 2026-09-10. Internally comparable across models AND effort rungs; cost/task is measured on one fixed suite, so it doubles as a total-token-load proxy.",
    "openai-docs-2026-09-10": "OpenAI's own model/effort docs, read 2026-09-10. Qualitative efficiency claims, no scores.",
    "carried-iteration-15": "Figures carried from this repo's iteration-13/15 research (2026-09-02 / 2026-09-08) that could NOT be re-verified on 2026-09-10. Kept for continuity, demoted in confidence, NOT comparable with any group above."
